# RizqWise Environment Variables (Optional - For Automatic Cloud Sync Across All Devices)
# 1. Create a free Supabase project at https://supabase.com
# 2. Run the SQL snippet from supabase/schema.sql (or copy from Settings -> Cloud Sync)
# 3. Paste your project URL and public Anon key below:

NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key-here
